## Evidence caveat

The transcript preserves the successful `ssh -i ~/.ssh/id_rsa webadmin@$BoxIP` login but not the exact earlier public-key placement command. The report therefore treats SSH as the observed trigger mechanism and does not claim an unrecorded key-injection command as transcript evidence.
